tMaxX=Infinity, tMaxY finite => else step j. Good. If dv=0, tMaxY=Infinity, 
tMaxX finite => if true step i. Good.

But if du>0 and u exactly integer, tMaxX = 1/du >0. If du<0 and u exactly 
